text = "my name is Selene im 16 years old, it's been two day since my parent left me for business trip 

i had to attend highschool 

my day went well without any problem

time pass and it's afternoon, the bell class rang

the highschool class is done for this day

on way home, i saw two person beating up a guy

i reach my phone to take a picture for my safety

it was a dumb decision....

bright flash coming up from my phone, alerted both of them 

i ran as fast as i can from them 

I ran to my home without looking back

now im at home, i must be safe


but.... where's my wallet? "

